      "notes": "`blocks` form with nested raw keeping its `> ` prefixes: the quoted paragraph is reflowed (bytes differ) but its visible text — with the continuation prefixes removed at depth 1 — is identical, so both the paragraph and the blockquote (container text = child text) norm-lock as `edited` 0.99.",
